	(text_box "Since it is very easy to accidentally use the wrong type of FFC cable, this connector is designed to be symmetrical so either type works.\nPresence detection pins are shorted to GND on mask side."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 123.19 0)
		(size 86.36 8.89)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "05d49c77-89a0-45aa-9eb0-328308c513ad")
	)
	(text_box "This part is not strictly nessesary, it is insurance against unforseen extra bus capacitance from the FFC or mask PCB.\nThis targets I2C FM (400 kHz), which has a bus capacitance limit of 400 pF.\n\nA conservative estimate of worst-case bus capacitances across the entire system is as follows:\n	Cable (1m FFC): 40 pF\n	Downstream I2C switch (TCA9546APW): 19 pF (input side) / 6 pF (per channel, 4 channels total)\n		Worst-case devices on one switch channel: 30 pF\n		Worst-case trace capacitance on one switch channel: 50 pF\nWorst-case scenario (All switch channels enabled): 403 pF (already over limit)\n\nAs capacitance estimates are conservative-worst case and there is no reason for all switch channels to be enabled, it is unlikely for the worst-case scenario to occur.\nHowever, this component is included to increase the safety margin should a similar event occur."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 39.37 83.82 0)
		(size 124.46 29.2099)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3421157c-5954-4017-a535-bb6571f8c87e")
	)
	(text_box "Provides a method to determine if the cable is seated correctly in hardware.\nThe pins for presence detection are shorted to ground on the mask PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 39.37 151.13 0)
		(size 80.01 6.3499)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7d575015-f977-4ea5-9fe0-bbe254c9ea76")
	)
